#!ipxe
# Local-asset override. Copy this file to local-vars.ipxe (next to menu.ipxe,
# in the TFTP root /config/menus) and point mirror_endpoint at your local nginx
# asset mirror. menu.ipxe chains local-vars.ipxe before boot.cfg, so this wins
# over boot.cfg's GitHub default. release_menu.sh excludes local-vars.ipxe from
# menus.tar.gz, so a lab IP never leaks into a shipped release.
set mirror_endpoint http://192.168.7.1:8080
